; Intent 12, SHAPE C — [a] on the definition, type application OMITTED.
;
; This is the third row of the 2x2 and it is the one that decides which half of
; the axis matters. It must behave IDENTICALLY to shape B: the application is
; inferred, so the definition's polymorphism is the whole difference from A.
(defn wanted [a] [(p (-> a Bool)) (xs (List a))] (List a) (Nil [a])
  (prop every-kept-element-passes [(p (-> Int Bool)) (xs (List Int))]
    (all [Int] p (wanted p xs))))
